Output docs/assets/wattari-gattari-demo.gif

Require node

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set FontFamily "Noto Sans Mono CJK KR"
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set CursorBlink false
Set LoopOffset 20%
Set Theme "Catppuccin Frappe"

Type "node src/demo-dock.mjs"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Alt\+X/
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 1s
Alt+X
Wait+Screen /transcript는 보존합니다/
Sleep 2s
Alt+X
Sleep 2s
Alt+N
Type "Document archive flow"
Tab
Sleep 1s
Enter
Wait+Screen /Document archive flow/
Sleep 3s
Alt+Q
